<!-- What is Virtual Physio -->
<section class="container" style="padding: 4rem 0;">
  <div class="section-header">
    <h2>What is Virtual Physiotherapy?</h2>
    <p>Expert physiotherapy delivered through video consultations</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid grid-2">
    <div>
      <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Video Call Treatment</h3>
      <p>Real-time consultations with licensed physiotherapists via secure video call. You can see and interact with your therapist just like an in-person visit.</p>
      
      <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem;">Home-Based Rehab Program</h3>
      <p>Customized exercise programs performed in your home. Your therapist guides you through movements, monitors form, and provides real-time feedback.</p>
      
      <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem;">Movement Assessment via Camera</h3>
      <p>Our therapists can accurately assess your movement patterns, posture, and functional limitations through video. They use the same assessment techniques as in-person care.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background: var(--primary-light); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 0.75rem;">
      <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 1rem;">How It Works</h3>
      <ol style="margin-left: 1rem; line-height: 2;">
        <li><strong>Book your appointment</strong> through our online scheduling system</li>
        <li><strong>Receive a video link</strong> via email with instructions</li>
        <li><strong>Test your technology</strong> 10 minutes before your appointment</li>
        <li><strong>Meet with your therapist</strong> via secure video call</li>
        <li><strong>Discuss your condition</strong> and goals</li>
        <li><strong>Receive treatment guidance</strong> and personalized exercises</li>
        <li><strong>Get a home program</strong> to continue between sessions</li>
        <li><strong>Track progress</strong> with follow-up sessions</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

